<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Druid profession</h1>
<p>Primary stats: BRA, DIV
</p><p>Only the healer can specialize to become a druid: a member of the Druids'
guild who was a healer, has never specialised and has at most two
professions can, from level 25, say "specialize" at the guild master, the
oak tree, and drink what it hands over.
</p><p>The Druid are a collective of peoples who use their divine abilities
to nurture and harness the powers of nature. With these powerful forces
at one's disposal, a Druid can command, manipulate and channel one's
surroundings, making the Druid a most formidable friend... Or foe.
</p><p>Attributes:
</p>
<pre> Bra	+3
 Div	+2
 Cha	+1
 Dex	 0
 HP	-1
 Str	-2
 Con	-3
 Mag	-7
</pre>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="The_guild">The guild</span></h2>
<p>The Druids' guild is in a cavern behind the waterfall in the Mystic Forest,
in Alquenburg. Its teachers are trees, and its master is the oak. To join,
first do the willow tree's quest: bring it the head of the Magical Ice
Beast of Mjorngar. Then type join at the oak. Evil characters, and members
of the Conjurers', Sorcerers' and Necromancers' guilds, can't join.
</p><p>See Also:
